// NEG / NOT / BNOT, and the four "evaluate the left, maybe skip the right"
// forms, each with its own keep-the-value jump: && is JUMP_IF_FALSE_KEEP,
// || is JUMP_IF_TRUE_KEEP, ?? is JUMP_IF_GHOST_KEEP, and ?. is
// GET_PROP_SAFE -- except `a?.x()`, which needs the keep-jump too.
yo x = 1
yap -x
yap !x
yap ~x
yo t = fax
yo f = cap
yap t && f
yap t || f
yo g = ghost
yap g ?? 5
yap g?.x
yap g?.x()
yap t ? 1 : 2
